  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Together4Value- &#xbf;Pamoja kwa Thamani&#xbf;: Tanzania-EU partnership for integrated mineral and agricultural value chains.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action aims to strengthen Tanzania&#xbf;s natural resource-based value chains by mobilising responsible investments that serve the shared interests of the EU and Tanzania &#xbf; notably economic growth, sustainability, climate resilience and strategic connectivity.To achieve this, the action is built around three specific objectives:1. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Catalyse responsible investments in Tanzania&#xbf;s critical minerals sector, fostering value chains integrated with European industries, enhancing ESG standards compliance and strengthening local value addition and beneficiation. Enhance competitiveness and sustainability of Tanzanian agricultural value chains, with increased linkages to EU markets and investment.3.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Improve the regulatory and investment climate to foster a business-friendly environment for EU investors.</narrative>
  </description>
